### 检查后端是否启动
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json


### 测试发送聊天消息
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好，我正在学习这个项目"
}

### 测试流式聊天
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请分五点介绍 Python，每点写两句话。"
}

### 创建会话
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Python 学习"
}
### 查看已保存消息
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chats/60a915f6-3f92-4f47-8e60-28c3add34267/messages
Accept: application/json